<!--
  Adaptive launcher icon background (API 26+). Value MUST equal the dark-mode bg token
  (黑曜石夜空) in src/styles/design-tokens.css; `tests/verify_android_assets.py` asserts this
  file's colours are a subset of design-tokens.json, so a token change that forgets the icon
  fails the gate instead of shipping a mismatched brand mark.

  Replaces the CLI template's `#FFFFFF`. The foreground (mipmap-*/ic_launcher_foreground.png)
  is still the Capacitor placeholder robot: a branded foreground needs artwork, and no image
  pipeline exists in this repo - recorded as a G4 delivery limitation rather than papered over.
-->
